SR: Yes	Effect: A touch from your hand, which is engulfed in darkness, disrupts a creature's vision by coating its eyes in supernatural darkness. Each touch causes the target to become blinded for 1 round unless it makes a successful Fortitude saving throw. You can use this melee touch attack up to 3 times. Any touch attack not used after 3 rounds is lost.	Target: Creature or creatures touched
